 Specifically,
 it details the position vector of the spherical image charge element (
\begin_inset Formula $\vec{P}_{dq'}$
\end_inset

) alongside the corresponding field displacement vector (
\begin_inset Formula $\vec{r}_{4}$
\end_inset

),
 which is directed from the source position (
\begin_inset Formula $\vec{P}_{dq'}$
