\end_inset

 and the 
\series bold
sign
\series default
 of the image charge.
 This section establishes the foundational vector transformation framework required to determine these spatial positions and directional orientations.
 Using these coordinate mappings,
 the classical Method of Images for a differential point charge in the presence of a grounded spherical conductor is analytically formulated.
