\end_inset
 for one cloud, created at the instant 
\begin_inset Formula $t_{inc}$
\end_inset
 and drifting as a rigid body by 
\begin_inset Formula $z_{d}(t)$
\end_inset
 (short for 
\begin_inset Formula $z_{\text{drift}}(t)$
\end_inset
) under the impulse voltage 
\begin_inset Formula $V(t)$
\end_inset
. Chapter 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
