literal "false"

\end_inset
, the only figure of the paper that shows the space-charge fields on their own. The figures that follow it in the paper (4 to 8) depend on how the space charge evolves in time; they are treated with the complete model in Section 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "sec:calibrated"
plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"
nolink "false"
