, a coarse quadrature, the unit of C, the streamer length and the digitization, was ruled out. The remaining difference cannot be resolved from the published information, and the reproduction is therefore considered qualitative. The paper's own description of how A, B and C were chosen, to give a field of about 5 kV/cm that is nearly uniform in the streamer region, was tried as a calibration of B and C; Appendix 
