\begin_layout Standard
The cone angle is a property of the discharge and the rod tip, not of the impulse, so this value is used for every streamer in Chapter 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "sec:calibrated"
plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"
nolink "false"
tuple "list"

\end_inset
. The fits of the digitized Figure 3 curves in Section 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "sec:repro_fig3_cases"
plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"
nolink "false"
