\begin_inset Formula $A$
\end_inset
 directly. For each pair 
\begin_inset Formula $(B,C)$
\end_inset
 on a grid (B from 1 to 3, C from 0.005 to 0.5 cm) the length is the root of the head condition, and the pair is scored by
\end_layout

